SUMMARY:Pumpkins After Dark Discounted + Dinner (Milton)
DESCRIPTION:Experience Toronto\nNote: The 10% off on the site may expire a
 t any time.\n\nOn **Saturday October 10th\,** **join us for Pumpkins After
  Dark in Milton.** Pumpkins After Dark is Canada's award-winning outdoor H
 alloween event - a family-friendly walk-through experience featuring more 
 than 10\,000 hand-carved jack-o'-lanterns lighting up trails every fall.\n
 This event is available in Canada\, the United States\, and Ireland. Each 
 season\, their team of artists hand-carves thousands of pumpkins\, builds 
 themed scenes - from dinosaurs and dragons to pop-culture icons - and ligh
 ts a glowing trail to wander together. No actors. No jump scares. Just cra
 ft\, wonder\, and the warm glow of a thousand pumpkins. We will be seeing 
 the **Show with the Maze** only. **Purchase your ticket for Pumpkins After
  Dark Show with the Maze on Saturday October 10th at 7:30pm.**\n\n**WEATHE
 R POLICY**:\n\n* This is an outdoor event and will run in the rain. The ev
 ent may be cancelled in the event of inclement weather\, unforeseen circum
 stances\, or other conditions that may impact safety. Ticket holders will 
 be notified of any changes via email\, which may occur without prior notic
 e.\n\n**TRANSPORTATION**:\n\n* Arrange for your own transportation. Feel f
 ree to post in the Comments if you want/need to carpool.\n* **Carpool atte
 ndees MUST have a picture and arrange a PUBLIC pick-up/ drop off spot for 
 the security of members**. Any risks associated with carpooling are borne 
 by the member\, and Experience Toronto cannot be held liable under any cir
 cumstances.\n\n**COST**\nGeneral Admission: Adult with Maze $32.95 + servi
 ce fee + taxes\n\nDiscounted: $29.96 + service fee + taxes\n\nMeetup Organ
 izer Fee: $10\n\nThere are no refunds.\n\n***\n\n**SIGNING-UP**\n\n* **RSV
 P Yes** **with your cell and email (required for out of town events)**\; *
 *everyone goes on the waitlist until they post they have purchased their t
 icket and have transportation)**\n* **[Purchase](https://milton.xpresstix.
 ca/)**[ ](https://www.tcomusic.ca/concert/opera-highlights-all-the-greates
 t-moments/#season-passes)**your own ticket for** **Pumpkins After Dark by 
 going to the month of October\, selecting Saturday October 10th\, 7:30pm t
 ime slot and Adult with Maze for $32.95\,** post you have purchased your t
 icket and have transportation\, and I will move you to going.\n\nA reminde
 r will be sent the day before with my cell and details where to meet and w
 hen.\n\nRSVPs close 2 days prior\, hoping there are still tickets\, and th
 e Waitlist will be removed at that time. Cancellations will result in a No
  Show and impact future attendance.\n\n**MEETUP TIME**\n**Meet me at: 7:25
 pm at Country Heritage Park at**\n**8560 Tremaine Rd\, Milton\, ON\, to th
 e right of the entrance After scanning your tickets. We will then head in 
 together.**\n\n**Time: 7:30 - 10:30pm** (people can leave whenever they wi
 sh)\n\n**Dinner: 8:45pm: I have made reservations for dinner a few mins aw
 ay.** I hope you will join.\n\nEnjoy and please post your comments in the 
 Event after.
