SUMMARY:Free - Soundstreams Violins Unbound (Broadview Ave)
DESCRIPTION:Experience Toronto\n**Note: In addition to RSVPing Yes\, you n
 eed to register for your free admission to this concert.**\n\nOn **Monday 
 November 2nd\, attend** **Violins Unbound** **for TD Encounters Soundstrea
 ms.** Few instruments can match the violin’s extraordinary combination o
 f brilliance\, agility\, and expressive power. This Encounters event will 
 showcase all that the violin can offer\, featuring violinists **Judith Fli
 edl**\, visiting from Austria on a Canadian tour\, and Toronto-based violi
 nist **Roan Ma**\, performing a world premiere for violin duet by **André
  Ristic**\, commissioned by Soundstreams. The program will also include wo
 rks by **John Beckwith**\, **Chris Paul Harman**\, **Parisa Sabet**\, **An
 a Sokolović**. A discussion and audience Q&A with Fliedl and Ma will foll
 ow the performance. **Register for your free admission to Violins Unbound*
 * **for TD Encounters Soundstream on Monday November 2nd at 7:30pm.**\n\n*
 *COST**\nTicket: Free\n\nMeetup Organizer Fee: $5\n\n**SIGNING-UP**\n\n* *
 *RSVP Yes**\n* **[Register](https://soundstreams.ca/events/td-encounters-v
 iolins-unbound-2/)\, post you have registered for free admission**\, and I
  will move you to going.\n\nA reminder will be sent the day before with my
  cell and reminder details where to meet and when.\n\nRSVPs close 2 days p
 rior hoping there are still spots available. The Waitlist will be removed 
 at that time. Cancellations will result in a No Show and impact future att
 endance.\n\n**MEETUP TIME**\n**Meet me at: 7pm inside Hugh's Room at 296 B
 roadview Ave.**\n\n**Start: 7:30pm**\n\nLength: 1 - 2 hours\n\nAfter: meet
  at the same spot to chat about the show\n\nEnjoy and please post your com
 ments in the Event after.
