SUMMARY:Our Little Secret: A True New Musical + Dinner (Yonge/Bloor Stn.)
DESCRIPTION:Experience Toronto\nOn **Friday\, November 6th\, join us for**
  Our Little Secret: A True New Musical. What does a 31-year-old theatre ki
 d do when he finds out his parents aren't quite who he thought they were? 
 Write a musical\, of course! ***OUR LITTLE SECRET*** is the hilarious\, mo
 ving\, and completely true story of Toronto performer Noam Tomaschoff's di
 scovery that he isn't an only child\, and he actually has more than 35 sib
 lings around the world. Blending comedy\, drama\, and addictive music\, **
 *OUR LITTLE SECRET*** will leave you laughing\, crying — and seeing your
  family in a whole new light. The show won the Patron’s Pick at Toronto'
 s Best of Fringe awards\, the annual Chrisparkle Award for Best Performanc
 e in a Musical in Edinburgh Fringe\, and won 5 BroadwayWorld Awards\, incl
 uding Best New Musical and Best Performance in a Musical. My seat is Lower
  Balcony 106. **Purchase** **Our Little Secret: A True New Musical** **on 
 Friday November 6th at 7:30pm.**\n\n**COST**\nRegular Cost: $39/ 59/ 79/ 9
 9 + service fees\n\nMeetup Organizer Fee: $5\n\n**Ticket Policy**: All sal
